  "text": "Capital Chronicle\n3 phút trước\nUpdate: September PPI: energy drove the goods surge as services rose\n\nThe BLS release of 15 October 2026 showed a 1.3% September headline rise and a 0.5% increase excluding foods, energy and trade services.\n\nWhat to watch: A lasting inflation signal from the September 2026 release would require repeated gains outside energy; weaker underlying readings would challenge it.\n\nRead the full brief: https://capitalchronicle.substack.com/p/september-ppi-energy-drove-the-goods\n\nRetrospective analysis, written on 5 November 2026 (GMT+7) Analysis, not financial advice. Readers decide whether to trade.\nẨn bớt",
